        "ignore": false,
        "order": 6,
        "anno_id": "box_id_3",
        "attribute": {},
        "text": "If it happens that $ \\mathbf{{AB}} = \\mathbf{{BA}} $ , we say that $ \\mathbf{A} $ and $ \\mathbf{B} $ commute. Most often,even when $ \\mathbf{{AB}} $ and $ \\mathbf{{BA}} $ are both defined, the products are not necessarily the same."
      },
