        "latex": "$$\\mathbf{A}\\mathbf{X} = \\left\\lbrack  \\begin{array}{cccccc} {a}_{11} & {a}_{12} & \\cdots & {a}_{1j} & \\cdots & {a}_{1N} \\\\  {a}_{21} & {a}_{22} & \\cdots & {a}_{2j} & \\cdots & {a}_{2N} \\\\  \\vdots & \\vdots & & \\vdots & & \\vdots \\\\  {a}_{k1} & {a}_{k2} & \\cdots & {a}_{kj} & \\cdots & {a}_{kN} \\\\  \\vdots & \\vdots & & \\vdots & & \\vdots \\\\  {a}_{M1} & {a}_{M2} & \\cdots & {a}_{Mj} & \\cdots & {a}_{MN} \\end{array}\\right\\rbrack  \\left\\lbrack  \\begin{array}{cccccc} {x}_{1} \\\\  {x}_{2} \\\\  \\vdots \\\\  {x}_{j} \\\\  \\vdots \\\\  {x}_{N} \\end{array}\\right\\rbrack   = \\left\\lbrack  \\begin{array}{cccccc} {b}_{1} \\\\  {b}_{2} \\\\  \\vdots \\\\  {b}_{j} \\\\  \\vdots \\\\  {b}_{M} \\end{array}\\right\\rbrack   = \\mathbf{B}.\\tag{8}$$"
